    %% Top-level relationships
    creator --> claude & codex & devin & vscode & lmstudio & antigravity

    claude -->|MCP_DOCKER profile| mcpgw
    claude -->|mcp-remote pieces| pieces
    codex -->|native tools + chat| apo
    devin -->|shell + PMP| pmp & axcontrol
    vscode -->|MCP + extensions| apo & codex
    cursor -->|MCP| apo
    chatgpt -->|native| apo
    lmstudio -.->|API 1234<br/>closed to curl| apo
    antigravity -->|local ports| apo
    pieces -->|MCP SSE| claude

    pmp -->|gates| axcontrol
    axcontrol -->|canon| sync & regdb

    apo -->|/v1/*| ollama & finalai
    apo -->|/tools/*| time_s & weather & filesystem & git_s & memory_s
    apo -->|/health| phoenix
    apo -->|lease/proxy| creds
    apo -->|mcp/*| mcpgw
    apo -->|writes| sync

    finalai -->|forward| titan

    ollama -->|selected model| ollamadb
    redis -->|cache/state| apo
    os_master -->|macos control| pmp

    phoenix -->|health check| hycred
    orchestrator -->|index| sync
    nightwatch -->|patrol logs| sync
    telemetry -->|metrics| sync

    time_s & weather & filesystem & git_s & memory_s -->|mounted in| sync

    dockerd -->|runs| hycred & kindcp & kindreg & dcp & prizz
    kindcp -->|provisions| dcp
    hycred -->|same port| creds
    mcpgw -->|pull from| mcpcatalog
    mcpcatalog -->|images from| dockerhub
    mcpprofile -->|selects from| mcpcatalog

    sync -->|contains| regdb
    regdb -->|aggregates| mcpdb & ollamadb & apocfg

    mcpgw -.->|cloud builder| cloudb
    apo -.->|unreachable| macmini
    sync -.->|missing path| external_vol
    product -.->|missing source| apo

    %% macOS helpers side note
    electron & appinkwe & language & node4624 & music -.->|parallel AI/native processes| AI_CLIENTS
